==English==

===Etymology===
Supposed to represent the sound of snoring.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|as spelled}} {{IPA|en|/zː/}}
* {{qualifier|imitation of snoring}} {{IPA|en|/ʩ<sup>ʀ</sup>/}}
* {{audio|en|Zzz.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Interjection===
{{en-interj}}

# A snoring sound, implying that somebody is [[asleep]].

