===Verb===
{{en-verb|zzzs|zzzing|zzzed}}

# {{lb|en|onomatopoeia}} To [[sleep]] or [[snore]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1909|author=H. G. Wells|title=Tono-Bungay|url=https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Page%3ATono-Bungay.djvu/469|page=461|passage=He lay back on his pillow, made a faint '''zzzing''' sound that ceased, and presently and quite quietly he died &mdash; greatly comforted by my assurance.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1996|author=Charlotte Abrams|title=The Silents|url=http://books.google.com/books?id=H8I6MWc5MogC&pg=PA42&dq=zzzed&hl=en&sa=X&ei=YLcVUavPFKjfigL0lYCwBg&ved=0CDwQ6AEwAQ|page=42|passage=He '''zzzed''' for a long time, bobbing back and forth, and then he let us go, pointing to two empty seats across the aisle and motioning for us to sit down.}}

